# Applies to the whole repository: every chapter, every subfolder.
# A folder can still have its own .gitignore for rules that only make sense there
# (e.g. dist/ in a Vite client); both files apply.

# Dependencies (recreated with npm install). The * also covers renamed copies
# such as node_modules.bak/ or node_modules-10.26.2026/.
node_modules*/

# Secrets: never commit them. .env.example is committed on purpose.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Instructor-only: a clone of the private solutions repo (see chat/private-solutions-repo.md).
.solutions/

# Logs and OS clutter
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
